      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**AI Agent Audit** — structured audit events (src/audit.py) ship as JSON lines to the /coldchain/dev/gateway CloudWatch Logs group (90-day retention).\n\n**Live panels**: CloudWatch aggregate METRICS (request/tool/rejection/error counts, reconcile state, SNS failures) (aggregates only — see the drill-down status panel at the bottom for the per-event limitation).\n\n**Event classes**: agent_request_end (status, duration, tool count), agent_tool_event (guard decision, approved views, rows, duration, error class), auth_failure (401s; pseudonymous actor only).\n\n**Privacy posture**: no prompts, no model responses, no SQL literals (rejected SQL is fingerprinted with values elided), no tokens or credentials. Actor is a pseudonymous API-key hash. request_id is the correlation key across every record."
      }
    },
